{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55512","headline":"绣 · 罗隐","name":"绣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一片丝罗轻似水，洞房西室女工劳。\n花随玉指添春色，鸟逐金针长羽毛。\n蜀锦谩夸声自贵，越绫虚说价犹高。\n可中用作鸳鸯被，红叶枝枝不碍刀。\n（见雍文华校本《罗隐集·甲乙集》，又见《四库全书》本《罗昭谏集》。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷六五六收此诗，缺三字，今重录。\n雍文华所据爲清张瓒瑞榴堂《罗昭谏集》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}